      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسَطَ</span></b> , (S, M, &amp;c.,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسِطَ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُسُوطٌ</span> (S, M, Mgh, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسْطٌ</span>,
